/mvnw text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Byte-for-byte fixtures. Git's own text detection only looks for NUL bytes, and the
# generated PDFs under src/test/data have none - so it "helpfully" checked them out with
# CRLF, which shifts every xref offset and makes PDFBox (and BizPlay's filebox) reject the
# file: "Missing root object specification in trailer".
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
